pullrequestreview-2991375815","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-06T14:34:29Z"},{"id":2991375992,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6yTMZ4","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-2991375992","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-06T14:34:49Z"},{"id":2991387452,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6yTPM8","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-2991387452","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-06T14:44:50Z"},{"id":2991390767,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6yTQAv","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?u=25817fe797fcc7a812ba9d7f58f593f5a003abbb&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","login":"syntaxerror247","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-2991390767","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-06T14:48:52Z"},{"id":2994475238,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6yfBDm","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"Test project: [NavigationBarProblem.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21105933/NavigationBarProblem.zip)\r\n\r\nTested on Samsung Tab S7 (Android 13) and LG Nexus 5X (Android 8)\r\n\r\nI had to modify MRP, disable Gradle build _(Godot 4.3 custom mods, probably no longer compatible)_, and take scaling into account.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _process(_delta):\r\n\t#https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86663#issuecomment-2132230189\r\n\tvar keyboard_height := DisplayServer.virtual_keyboard_get_height()\r\n\tself.size.y = get_viewport_rect().size.y - (keyboard_height / get_viewport_transform().get_scale().y)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nOn the LG Nexus 5X (Android 8), there are problems when Immersive mode is enabled. As soon as the keyboard appears, Immersive mode is exited. Probably OS specific. On Samsung Tab S7 (Android 13), I couldn't find any issues.\r\n\r\n<details><summary> Video: Issues / Test LG Nexus 5X, Immersive mode + Edge To Edge </summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6277beee-df27-40b2-8936-18558bef982d\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nInput field is suddenly behind the navigation bar when the keyboard is hidden again.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-2994475238","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-07T16:04:28Z"},{"id":3003169364,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6zALpU","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"It works better than before on Nexus 5X Android 8, in `Immersive Mode`.\r\n\r\nHowever, if `Immersive Mode` is disabled and `Edge to Edge` is enabled, the input field behind the navigation bar disappears. Partially on the Samsung Tab S7, and completely on the Nexus 5X.\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Screenshots</summary>\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b398fb03-dc2c-4f8f-80aa-2be61fc26610)\r\n\r\n### Samsung Tab S7 (Android 13)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f35f3880-ee02-4583-ac8c-d7b161a3df8e)\r\n\r\n![Bildschirmfoto 2025-07-09 um 23 25 16](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da0e68ec-ce8b-4264-8328-9ea717fe14ad)\r\n\r\n-----------------\r\n\r\n### Google Nexus 5X (Android 8)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/062212e3-ccb1-4edf-a082-76c3f5ea1f29)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ea62c8d-7cbd-491f-8010-fbacd6e01333)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-3003169364","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-09T21:29:24Z"},{"id":3003208191,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6zAVH_","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"See above. \r\n\r\nCan you reproduce it? Otherwise, I'll check it more closely on my device later.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-3003208191","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-09T21:45:59Z"},{"id":3027229613,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc60b9ut","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"d8d3c86d71e0eef4ffc21b90a97e3d08a715015d","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"[NavigationBarProblem.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21268180/NavigationBarProblem.zip)\r\n\r\nIt looks good on Android 13 (Samsung Tab S7). However, I had to modify the test project to make it work with every possible combination. \r\n\r\n<details><summary>A hack/workaround for `edge-to-edge` (without immersive). </summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _process(_delta):\r\n\tvar safe_area := DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area()\r\n\tvar edge_height = DisplayServer.window_get_size().y - safe_area.size.y - safe_area.position.y\r\n\t\r\n\t#https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86663#issuecomment-2132230189\r\n\tvar keyboard_height := DisplayServer.virtual_keyboard_get_height()\r\n\tif keyboard_height == 0:\r\n\t\tkeyboard_height += edge_height\r\n\tvar scale_y := get_viewport_transform().get_scale().y \r\n\tself.size.y = get_viewport_rect().size.y - (keyboard_height / scale_y)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI think this hack wasn't necessary in the first version a week ago.\r\nBut we can get feedback first and see later if we can optimize it further.\r\nThe most important thing is that the input field is not hidden behind the navigation bar.\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Tests on Android 13 (Samsung OS / Keyboard)</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ea55f83-d0bb-4862-9b01-e5cd1d798929\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ee25c1d-1950-40c1-8807-1d8e780a5d32\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n------------------\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Tests on Android 8.1 (Google OS / Keyboard)</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNote here `safe_area` is determined differently than under Samsung Android 13, because of the hack/workaround the initial state is wrong (without keyboard)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ce5cf6c-1643-4e2f-8270-26f0312c59c8\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56b5d13b-d795-498b-9c6b-b7d2e34a8794\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108287#pullrequestreview-3027229613","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108287","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-16T23:26:30Z"}]